---
// TripSupportIntro Section
// Shared between the Home Page and the top of the Trip Support Page
---

<section id="trip-support" class="trip-intro">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <p class="overline">Global Trip Support</p>
      <h2 class="heading">Seamless Flight Operations, <span>Anywhere You Fly</span></h2>
      <p class="description">
        We provide end-to-end trip support tailored to international operators, VIP flights, and executive travel. From permits and flight planning to on-the-ground coordination, we ensure every journey is flawless.
      </p>
      <a href="/trip-support" class="btn-primary">Explore Services ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .trip-intro {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    background: #0D2137;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .overline {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .heading {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .heading span {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .description {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.9rem 2.5rem;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
</style>
